<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Brinker, Cracker Barrel.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Brinker, Cracker Barrel.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>NatWest Securities said it upgraded Brinker International Inc and Cracker Barrel Old Country Store Inc to trading buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Brinker was off 1-1/16 to 16-1/4, Cracker Barrel was up 1-7/16 to 26-3/4.</p>
</text>
